{"id":"d047c260971950e0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-strong-law.md","title":"Schnorr 随机序列的大数定律","display":"thm-schnorr-strong-law — Schnorr 随机序列的大数定律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-strong-law","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-strong-law"],"display":"thm-schnorr-strong-law — Schnorr 随机序列的大数定律","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]","[[43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-strong-law"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-strong-law</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-strong-law — Schnorr 随机序列的大数定律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82047d3b859c7b80\" href=\"?note=82047d3b859c7b80\" title=\"43-df-total-solovaytest\">43-df-total-solovaytest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1ec557e9594de2d8\" href=\"?note=1ec557e9594de2d8\" title=\"43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay\">43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；Schnorr随机性及总Solovay检验见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"82047d3b859c7b80\" href=\"?note=82047d3b859c7b80\" title=\"43-df-total-solovaytest\">43-df-total-solovaytest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：对固定有理ε&gt;0，坏集B_n={Y:|n<sup>{-1}∑_{i&lt;n}Y(i)−1/2|&gt;ε}是统一可计算闭开集。二项分布或Hoeffding界μ(B_n)≤2e</sup>{-2ε²n}给有效可求尾界，故∑μ(B_n)可计算。总Solovay刻画令X只有限命中。对可数有理ε取合取即得。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-total-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"82047d3b859c7b80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay","status":"resolved","id":"1ec557e9594de2d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Schnorr随机性及总Solovay检验见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-total-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"82047d3b859c7b80","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Schnorr随机性及总Solovay检验见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i<n}X(i)=\\frac12.","display":true}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-strong-law]] — Schnorr 随机序列的大数定律"}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3","82047d3b859c7b80","1ec557e9594de2d8"]}